      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say things get better but it just feels like a lie. when everyone turns their back on u and u have nothing left to offer the world... it feels like i'm just taking up space. like there's no real reason to keep trying to force myself back into a world that clearly doesnt want me anymore.",
